.DS_Store
.idea*
.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gradle / build output.
#
# The instrumented apps are rebuilt locally, and their build directories total
# several GB. They are excluded wholesale, with ONE deliberate exception: the
# compiled .class directories named in each app's class_files.json are required
# for Jacoco to turn probe data into line coverage, so those are force-added
# (git add -f). Not shipping them is the exact gap that made coverage read 0%
# in the original repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/build/
.gradle/
**/.gradle/
local.properties
*.iml
.kotlin/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Logs and scratch output from dataset building / test runs
*.log
dataset_builder/logs/
dataset_builder/__pycache__/
fuzzingandroid/FuzzerEngine/fuzzerengine/temp

# Emulator snapshots are 1.3 GB each and are regenerated per run
*.avd/snapshots/

# Third-party credentials that ship with upstream app sources.
# Not needed for coverage: none of these sit inside a declared
# classfiles/sourcefiles path. Excluded so this repository does not
# re-publish other projects secrets.
google-services.json
*.keystore
*.jks
*.jks.gpg

# Bulk output of dataset_builder/verify_reports.py.
#
# Only report_validation.csv (the verdict per entry) and the per-entry
# jacococli-output.txt (which shows the mismatch-warning count) are committed.
# The XML and HTML come to 634 MB for 61 apps, are regenerated by one command,
# and describe synthesized execution data rather than a measurement - unlike
# results/smoke/, which is real device output and is kept in full.
results/report-validation/**/synthetic.exec
results/report-validation/**/coverage.xml
results/report-validation/**/coverage_html/

# Compiled helper classes for dataset_builder/tools/SynthExec.java
dataset_builder/tools/classes/
